flowchart TD
    A[Inicio runId] --> B[Leer watermark CDZ]
    B --> C[Calcular ventana UTC + overlap]
    C --> D{Ventana valida?}
    D -- No --> E[Responder no-op]
    D -- Si --> F[Crear exportacion Soyio]
    F --> G[Polling hasta completed/failed/timeout]
    G --> H{Completed?}
    H -- No --> X[Error critico, no avanzar watermark]
    H -- Si --> I[Descargar CSV]
    I --> J[Guardar CSV crudo en RDZ]
    J --> K[Autenticar User Reference]
    K --> L[Segmentar referencias validas]
    L --> M[Resolver referencias con reintentos]
    M --> N[Expandir data_permissions]
    N --> O[Conservar errores y revocaciones]
    O --> P[Guardar CSV normalizado en DDZ]
    P --> Q[Escribir _SUCCESS]
    Q --> R[Actualizar watermark e historial]
    R --> S[Responder completed o completed_with_errors]
